---
/**
 * Weather line in the top bar.
 *
 * Phase 4 fills this in from Open-Meteo in the browser, so the page itself
 * stays cacheable at the edge and the Worker spends no CPU on it. Until that
 * island runs, the line stays hidden rather than showing invented numbers.
 */
---

<span class="topbar__weather weather" data-weather hidden>
	<strong class="weather__temp"></strong>
	<span class="weather__place"></span>
	<span class="weather__detail"></span>
</span>
